Package: EconR
Type: Package
Title: Consistent Econometric Models with Model-Specific Missing-Data Handling
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person('David', 'Bustamante', role = c('aut','cre'), email = 'david@example.com')
Description: A consistent interface for econometric estimation. The first release implements ordinary and weighted least squares with formula-aware missing-data handling, heteroskedasticity-consistent and clustered covariance estimation, prediction, residuals, fitted values, and standard model methods.
